cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "QIIME2_ITS"
abstract: >-
  A QIIME2 pipeline for single-end (IonTorrent) and paired-end (Illumina) ITS
  metabarcoding data: ITSxpress for ITS region extraction, DADA2 for
  denoising, plus diversity statistics, sample classification, and a PDF
  summary report.
